# ACD process

Before coding in this repo:

1. Follow [docs/DEVELOPMENT-GUIDELINES.md](docs/DEVELOPMENT-GUIDELINES.md).
2. Pick the feature from [docs/feature-registry.md](docs/feature-registry.md); load only that feature doc.
3. Docs outrank code. Run `make test`. One feature outcome per change.

See also root `AGENTS.md` / `CLAUDE.md`.
